/* Estate File v1K — English/French language layer.

   English source text stays in app.js. t("...") returns the French version
   when the interface is French and the English source otherwise. A missing
   entry falls back to English and is recorded in FR_MISSES so the test suite
   can fail before a mixed-language build is shipped.

   Legal programme, court and form names are kept in their official form where
   that is clearer than inventing a translated title. The translation changes
   presentation only; numbers, fees, dates, phone numbers and estate data are
   shared by both languages.
*/

