  "Have the Social Insurance Number in front of you before you dial.": "Ayez le numéro d'assurance sociale sous les yeux avant d'appeler.",
  "Health Link Alberta": "Health Link Alberta",
  "Health Links–Info Santé": "Health Links–Info Santé",
